cockpit-sharehub (0.13.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Versioning: scheduled read-only versions of a share (ZFS snapshots or
    Btrfs read-only subvolumes) every 15 minutes or hourly, with
    15-minute/hourly/daily/weekly/monthly retention, shown as Windows
    Previous Versions; new sharehub-snapshot.timer.
  * Protected recycle bin: hidden from clients, limit on versions kept
    per deleted file.
  * Restore dialog: browse versions and deleted files, restore without
    overwriting current files.

 -- Andrei Prajina <ancyent@xserv.ro>  Wed, 18 Nov 2026 00:30:00 +0200

cockpit-sharehub (0.12.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Containers: detect LXC/Docker; NFS is marked unsupported and cannot
    be enabled where the kernel NFS server is unavailable.
  * WS-Discovery works with wsdd-server or wsdd2 (Debian 13 ships wsdd2).
  * Components dashboard: packages missing from the package sources are
    shown as "Not available" with guidance instead of an Install button.
  * Compatibility report printed at install time and a per-feature verdict
    with a system summary on the dashboard.
  * Finder icon picker with previews in Settings -> SMB.

 -- Andrei Prajina <ancyent@xserv.ro>  Tue, 17 Nov 2026 23:30:00 +0200

